# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# LegacyMark — Docker Ignore
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Dependencies (reinstalled in Docker)
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build artifacts
.next
**/dist
**/.turbo

# Dev & IDE
.git
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo

# Environment (secrets — never bake into images)
.env
.env.local
.env.production
.env.docker

# Docs & meta
README.md
LICENSE
*.md
docs/

# Portfolio & non-service assets
portfolio/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Test & coverage
coverage/
**/__tests__
**/*.test.*
**/*.spec.*